TITLE:: InsightHistoryView
summary:: the loudness history pane of an Insight window
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel

DESCRIPTION::
Short term loudness over the last link::Classes/Insight#-historySeconds:: (one or five minutes in the window), newest at the right; the target as an outlined band, the integrated loudness dotted and named.

A UserView the link::Classes/InsightPanel:: puts in a titled pane. It reads the insight and draws what it finds; the panel's updater calls refresh.

table::
## strong::drag up and down:: || the target; shift: finer
## strong::wheel:: || the target in 1 LU steps (shift: 0.1)
## strong::double click:: || -14 LUFS
## strong::hover:: || a line and the loudness at that moment
::

